[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13156.79, "timestamp": "03:39:16", "text": "让他解释一下。让他解释一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13160.15, "timestamp": "03:39:20", "text": "我的天啊。好的，怎么了？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13163.11, "timestamp": "03:39:23", "text": "发生了吗？发生了什么？我得到了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13164.63, "timestamp": "03:39:24", "text": "感觉。不，等等。坚持，稍等。或许是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13168.229, "timestamp": "03:39:28", "text": "渡渡鸟玩耍。也许是吧。不，不，不。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13171.03, "timestamp": "03:39:31", "text": "不，也许这是渡渡鸟的表演。或许是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13173.91, "timestamp": "03:39:33", "text": "因为我们还有渡渡鸟，记得吗？我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13176.63, "timestamp": "03:39:36", "text": "看见她跑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13178.389, "timestamp": "03:39:38", "text": "他说可能是吉野。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13182.07, "timestamp": "03:39:42", "text": "真是怪异极了。是的，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13183.83, "timestamp": "03:39:43", "text": "听着，听着。我们有一只渡渡鸟。我们有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13187.11, "timestamp": "03:39:47", "text": "渡渡鸟。我们有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13189.269, "timestamp": "03:39:49", "text": "我打算跳过。我不知道。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13190.87, "timestamp": "03:39:50", "text": "可能处于劣势。为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13195.429, "timestamp": "03:39:55", "text": "异常安静？救救我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13197.67, "timestamp": "03:39:57", "text": "他选择这样做非常可疑。"}]